# Title: Testing Rules
# Applies: Testing

- Follow TDD loop rigorously.
- Test real production code paths; avoid test-only logic.
- Unit, integration, e2e; tests live next to code.
- Shared fixtures in `conftest.py`.
- Coverage ≥ 80% with focus on core flows.

Commands:
- uv run pytest
- uv run pytest --cov=src --cov-report=html